  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself or your favorite basketball enthusiast in cozy warmth with this personalized sports blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this customized blanket features a unique vintage ball and shoes sports design, making it a wonderful decorative piece for a bedroom couch, sofa, or travel adventure.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your blanket with a custom name and number to create a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fleece &amp; Sherpa Options:</strong> Crafted with two high-quality polyester layers, available in both ultra-soft Fleece and cozy Sherpa fabric.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes to meet your needs: Small (40x30 in), Medium (50x40 in), Large (60x50 in), or X-Large (80x60 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Comfort:</strong> Ideal for napping, reading, travel, camping, or lounging on the couch while watching your favorite sports games.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying microfiber fabric fluffs up beautifully after air drying without heat.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small/Medium/Large/X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
